        <mxCell id="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-150" value="&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How strongly does the claim&#39;s custodianship resist fabrication and error?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Observed Patterns)&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#D5D5D5;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=none;spacingRight=2;spacingLeft=2;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-149" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="180" height="500" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="180" height="500" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-151" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- All chains to the earthly Jesus depend on unknown transmission or lost works.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The earthly Jesus never wrote anything himself.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Mark depends on Papias&#39; lost work, an unnamed &quot;Elder&quot;, and unknown oral transmission from Irenaeus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Matthew depends on Papias, unknown oral tradition, and the lost Q/Logia source.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Luke depends on unknown oral transmission and unknown eyewitness accounts.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;John depends solely on the oral testimony of one witness and was not written by that witness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paul never met the earthly Jesus.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- All&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Jewish Christian writings are lost, surviving only through hostile authors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Ebionite chains depend on lost works, unknown transmitters, and hostile sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Gnostic chains rely on secret, hidden, and unknown lines of transmission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- All Gospels portray Jesus as someone with divine authority.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Mark: Jesus forgives sins, has power over nature, and expels evil spirits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Matthew: Jesus has all authority in heaven and earth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Luke: Jesus is the Lord of the Sabbath and accepted worship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- John: Jesus is explicitly divine and pre-existent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gospels agree on core historical events but differ in details.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The Gospels&#39; testimonies could be used in court, as they all corroborate the theologically significant events, such as:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Crucifixion timing differs, but crucifixion is unanimous.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Cross inscription wording differs, but &quot;King of the Jews&quot; is unanimous.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- First witnesses to the empty tomb differ, as well as who they saw there and what they said, but witnesses to an empty tomb is unanimous.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The stronger the chain, the higher the Christology.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Synoptic stream: lower Christology than John and Paul, and rely on unknown transmission and lost works.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- John: highest Gospel Christology, and a single unwritten oral source.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paul: clearest and strongest Christology, with the strongest transmission chain.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The later the Gospel, the higher the Christology.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Reconstruction of Q/Logia: lowest Christology; omitting the death and resurrection of Jesus as the primary means of salvation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Mark: low Christology; no virgin birth, no pre-existence, and is the only one to identify Jesus as the &quot;son of Mary&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Matthew: medium-low Christology; mentions his virgin birth and identifies him as Emmanuel (&quot;God is with us&quot;) as the fulfilment of Old Testament prophecies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Luke: medium-high Christology; identifies Jesus as the universal Savior (not just for Jews) and as someone who can forgive sins - a prerogative of God&#39;s alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- John: highest Christology; explicitly identifying Jesus as divine and pre-existing from the beginning of the text.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- While a minority, textual variants in the preserved manuscripts affect the Christological rating of their passages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Paul&#39;s authority primarily rests on his vision.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Paul states he did not learn his gospel from any man, but received it through a direct, private revelation of the risen Jesus. His &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;original&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;verification by the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; text-align: center; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;leaders of the Jerusalem Church was also done in private.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-149" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="180" width="315" height="500" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="500" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-152" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Quran&#39;s transmission traces to a single, public, fully-identified source.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Muhammad is the sole earthly source for Quranic content, reciting it publicly for 23 years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The 13-year Makkan period was more about core theology (comprising 75% of the Quran), while the 10-year Madinan period was more about the law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;No part of the Quran depends on lost works, secret teachers, unknown transmitters, or anonymous oral chains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Opponents, allies, and neutral tribes all witnessed the same recitations, creating an open-environment custodianship (not esoteric, scholarly, or elite-circle transmission).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Quran was preserved orally and textually, and by the public community and known individuals.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Revelations were delivered in identifiable contexts, such as during public gatherings, responses to specific events, or interactions with known individuals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Large-scale memorization across independent individuals and tribes allowed redundancy across a large, geographic region. Its chain is openly distributed, not privately linear.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The Quran was recited publicly and daily in communal prayers, in which the reciter could be immediately corrected by those behind him.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Standardization occurred by eyewitnesses early, while they were alive&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Multiple designated scribes recorded passages immediately as revelations were received, in which Muhammad could listen and verify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;These were preserved as written fragments until 1-2 years after Muhammad&#39;s death, in which the first caliph (Abu Bakr) ordered their compilation into a single, written standard (the &lt;i&gt;rasm&lt;/i&gt;), safeguarded by Hafsah b. Umar (one of Muhammad&#39;s wives).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;No enduring rival Qurans survived - even amid early political and sectarian fragmentation.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Islamic factions were fundamentally political, without generating alternative theological texts in addition to or replacing the Quran. Moreover, while some alternative Qurans and claims to prophethood did appear, they were politically or tribally motivated and were all extinguished during Muhammad&#39;s life or within a year after his death.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The closest thing to &quot;different Qurans&quot; would be the qira&#39;at (accepted ranges of pronunciation), but they trace to known individuals, are considered valid (having being authorized by Muhammad himself), and only affect pronunciation or minor synonyms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Uthmanic standardization only codified the Quran&#39;s pronunciation and diacritical script, as the core text had already been standardized earlier.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Since the 7th century Arabs lacked a literary presence (beyond oral poetry and the Quran), they didn&#39;t have a sophisticated written language established - with writings serving more as aids to memorization rather than primary sources - kind of like shorthand English. Since they were masters of their language, they would be able to look at the simplified script and know how it is supposed to be pronounced. Even the Quran&#39;s standardization under Abu Bakr was written in a&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;rasm&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;(consonantal skeleton).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- As a result, when the textual Quran was transmitted in non-Arab regions, they weren&#39;t as acquainted with this style and pronounced it according to their own dialects - which weren&#39;t authorized and caused disputes. In response, Uthman enlisted Zaid b. Thabit (the same scribe who oversaw the original Quranic standardization) - as well as several others - in standardizing the Quran&#39;s pronunciation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Uthman also ordered the burning of all unofficial Quranic manuscripts (this was seen as a respectful way to dispose of texts that contained God&#39;s name in it) to ensure that the standardized text would remain in circulation, and to prevent far-reaching areas to fragment of theological differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;align=left;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-149" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="495" width="315" height="500" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="500" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-153" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-148" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="500" width="810" height="455" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-154" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;How strongly does the claim&#39;s custodianship resist fabrication and error?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;(Steelmanned Defense)&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#D5D5D5;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=none;spacingRight=2;spacingLeft=2;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-153" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="180" height="455" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="180" height="455" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-155" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Absence of evidence is not evidence of absence.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The existence of some unknowns doesn&#39;t necessitate unreliability. This is actually very common and expected in oral societies at the time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- If the Gospels are rejected on that basis, then Aristotle&#39;s work, Homer&#39;s Iliad, and all other non-contemporary historical documents and people would similarly be considered unreliable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The absence of rival texts reflects the success of the early Church in extinguishing false claims.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The preserved manuscripts and independent streams corroborate one another.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- They all converge on the same core events: Jesus&#39;s ministry, his divine miracles and authority, crucifixion, and resurrection. Human error, even if it exists, doesn&#39;t detract from these events. Moreover, the creeds mentioned in Paul&#39;s earliest writings (ex. 1 Corinthians 15:3-7, Philippians 2:5-11, etc.) show high Christology before any other text was written. As such,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;the redundancy from independent origins makes a late, singular fabrication highly improbable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 8px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Additionally, we have thousands of manuscripts today in various languages, giving us a robust method for verification. Variants can be analyzed, and the original texts can be faithfully reconstructed - which show that the documents from the earliest manuscripts largely correspond to what we have today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Criterion of embarrassment strengthens credibility.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The Gospels preserve details that would have been unhelpful for a growing movement, such as the disciples&#39; cowardice, Peter&#39;s denial of Jesus, and the shameful execution of their Messiah by crucifixion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Crucially, all four Gospels report that women were the first witnesses to the resurrection. In a culture where female testimony was considered unreliable, this detail runs contrary to what one would invent to create a persuasive story.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paul himself went through great suffering for his claim - it is inconceivable to explain why he was willing to die for his message if he knew that it was wrong.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 8px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Differing Christologies don&#39;t contradict each other and reflect progressive revelation, not gradual development.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Each author, writing for a different audience, made intentional theological choices about what to emphasize. However, a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; text-align: center; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;ll four Gospels are rooted in the same, complete truth about Jesus&#39;s divine identity, which was understood by the apostles from the beginning. As such, they complement each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; text-align: center; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The theory of a &quot;gradually developing&quot; Christology is challenged by the fact that Paul&#39;s letters - the earliest Christian documents - contain the highest and most explicit Christology, proving the belief in Jesus&#39;s divinity was present from the very beginning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; text-align: center; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- P&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;aul&#39;s authority is the strongest proof of the Gospels&#39; divine origin.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;He received direct revelation from the risen Christ, perfectly aligning with the core message of the Jerusalem apostles. And His chains provides two powerful, independent lines of testimony to the same truth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Paul used to be an active persecutor of the early church. As such, his dramatic transformation requires an extraordinary explanation, which can only be attributed to a direct encounter with the risen Christ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-153" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="180" width="315" height="455" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="455" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-156" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- It is impossible for the preserved Quran to be different than what Muhammad recited, and it must have been revealed during his lifetime.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The Quran is not a book of history: it speaks into live disputes, questions, accusations, negotiations, and community events - clearly assuming shared, real-time knowledge with its first audience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Its verses respond directly to unpredictable, contemporary situations, such as private conversations, military setbacks, political betrayals, and personal scandals. A later fabrication or committee would have needed to reconstruct countless micro-events and tribal dynamics with impossible precision, in front of an audience that directly lived those moments and could publicly challenge any deviation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This is especially relevant given that this was the very period in which fiercely independent tribes were being unified - thus their power to collectively witness events only grew. A fabricated scripture from an unknown source would have fractured them further, rather than rally them around a single text and a single religion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Muhammad is the only possible candidate for the Quran&#39;s revelation, and his illiteracy (relative to the Quran&#39;s eloquence) is a proof of divine origin.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;T&lt;font&gt;he Quran&#39;s linguistic sophistication, structural originality, and rhetorical force exceed the demonstrated output of Muhammad&#39;s own speech, poetry, correspondence, and time in his day to produce such a work. This would have required years of specialized education that would have been beyond the hearsay he would hear from his job as a merchant, making self-authorship implausible.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The Quran&#39;s eloquence is such that&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;no prior linguistic system was sophisticated enough to explain it, and so it became the grammatical standard for the Arabic language itself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Yet at the same time, no alternative author or historical committee fits the established historical record&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;: the Quran emerged through continuous public recitation, without revisions or hidden editorial phases yet requiring specialized education, and in full view of allies and opponents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;As such, early fabrication would have required coordination across hostile tribes, rival poets, and specialized, educated audiences -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;all of whom had strong motive and opportunity to expose forgery against each other - yet no rival claimant or counter-text ever emerged.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Preservation errors are historically implausible under the Quran&#39;s transmission environment, and logically demonstrable today.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The Quran was recited publicly, daily, and from memory by large groups of people, creating live error-correction (from Muhammad to the average person): any alteration in public prayer, recitation, or teaching would be immediately challenged by those who memorized the same passage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- The non-chronological order of the Quran&#39;s verses doesn&#39;t affect the content of those verses. Moreover, we can reasonably reconstruct a chronological ordering of the Quran today, which doesn&#39;t expose any theological differences. This shows the Quran&#39;s timelessness, as this change occurred to transcend the context of 7th century Arabia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- As such, the live, public revelation of the Quran paired with the memory, accessibility, and liturgical practices of Muhammad&#39;s community make preservation errors highly unlikely, especially since the earliest manuscripts corroborate what we have today. Moreover, its logical coherence is timeless and can be demonstrably verified by anyone in any given time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-153" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="495" width="315" height="455" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="455" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-157" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font&gt;5. Resistance to Fabrication (continued)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=18;fillColor=#DAE8FC;gradientColor=#7EA6E0;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-147" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="810.0000000000001" height="44.9999999999999" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" link="data:page/id,wSjUeYOFd7Q6O4Wm3PFX" id="0m-NJcD45yl806iwIY74-0">
          <mxCell style="group" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
            <mxGeometry x="780" y="4420" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="0m-NJcD45yl806iwIY74-1" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=none;rotation=-180;opacity=1;" parent="0m-NJcD45yl806iwIY74-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="3.552713678800501e-15" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" id="0m-NJcD45yl806iwIY74-2">
          <mxCell style="shape=flexArrow;endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#B3B3B3;" parent="0m-NJcD45yl806iwIY74-0" edge="1">
            <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
              <mxPoint y="25.000000000000004" as="sourcePoint" />
              <mxPoint x="40" y="25.000000000000004" as="targetPoint" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" link="data:page/id,Z-l9n-z4b5n7cfZyjVss" id="D2xkHatob7_55zC870lq-0">
          <mxCell style="group;rotation=-180;" parent="i-ldhcgxSOpe3z3huQwf-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="4420" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="D2xkHatob7_55zC870lq-1" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=none;rotation=-360;opacity=1;" parent="D2xkHatob7_55zC870lq-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" id="D2xkHatob7_55zC870lq-2">
          <mxCell style="shape=flexArrow;endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#B3B3B3;" parent="D2xkHatob7_55zC870lq-0" edge="1">
            <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
              <mxPoint x="50" y="25" as="sourcePoint" />
              <mxPoint x="10" y="25" as="targetPoint" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="6. Historical Comparison (6/10)" id="wSjUeYOFd7Q6O4Wm3PFX">
    <mxGraphModel dx="499" dy="-4934" grid="1" gridSize="5" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" background="#CCCCCC" math="0" shadow="0" adaptiveColors="none">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-0" />
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-1" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-0" />
        <UserObject label="Historicity&amp;nbsp;Comparison: Bible vs. Quran (6/10)" link="data:page/id,lkuSvPZcJC7dHRsydWrw" id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-27">
          <mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E6E6E6;fontSize=20;" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="5520" width="810" height="50" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-83" value="" style="group" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="5585" width="810.0000000000001" height="979.9999999999973" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-84" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font&gt;5. Resistance to Fabrication (continued)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=18;fillColor=#DAE8FC;gradientColor=#7EA6E0;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-83" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="810.0000000000001" height="44.9999999999999" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-85" value="" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;spacingRight=0;" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-83" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="45" width="810" height="934.9999999999973" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-86" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-85" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="810" height="935" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-87" value="&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How strongly does the claim&#39;s custodianship resist fabrication and error?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Requirements for Trusting Defense)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Speculation is not refutation. To be able to distinguish between truth and falsehood, there must be some identifiable property between competing claims that renders one true and the other false.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What is the epistemological difference between reasonable and unreasonable uncertainty?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Acceptance of known constraints: while both assess the uncertainty of a claim, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;reasonable uncertainty respects the strength of their established constraints, while unreasonable uncertainty ignores them - speculating about the unknown instead of reasoning from evidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What is the epistemological difference between retroactive assumption and hyperskepticism?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;What is assumed without evidence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;both appeal to higher-level inference while dismissing the evidence itself, with retroactive assumption accepting truth (without foundational proof) and hyperskepticism rejecting truth (without foundational proof).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#D5D5D5;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=none;spacingRight=2;spacingLeft=2;" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-86" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="180" height="935" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="180" height="935" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-88" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Independently establishing Paul&#39;s reliability and alignment with what the earthly Jesus said (before claiming truth)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The existence of some unknowns doesn&#39;t necessitate unreliability. This is actually very common and expected in oral societies at the time.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;It is true that ancient oral societies commonly preserved information through unknown transmitters, and the mere existence of unknowns does not automatically invalidate a tradition. However, to meaningfully trust these unknowns, we must be able to distinguish between&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;reliable and unreliable unknowns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reliable unknowns&lt;/b&gt;: possible range of outcomes have known constraints&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;Unreliable unknowns&lt;/b&gt;: possible range is open-ended or speculative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Therefore, the real criterion is the reliability of the unknown&#39;s constraints, not cultural commonality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;The key question is not whether unknowns were common, but whether their outcomes were constrained enough to distinguish truth from falsehood.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Without assessing the constraints of each unknown step, both truth and fabrication remain equally possible, leaving no epistemological difference between them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;This can be shown by applying the same principle in reverse, as the existence of unknowns doesn&#39;t necessitate reliability either.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Thus, unknowns may not force unreliability - but they do force uncertainty - and accepting them as &quot;good enough&quot; always involves some degree of speculation (as if there is no speculation, then it must be &quot;known&quot;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The absence of rival texts reflects the success of the early Church in extinguishing false claims.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This may be true, but n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;o ancient text survives by accident: it survives only because an institution with power, money, and infrastructure continuously copies it for centuries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- As such, for this argument to have substance, t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;his requires that the historical disappearance of rivals be a sign of their falsehood&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;. To verify this, we would need to be able to distinguish between power-based suppression and truth-based suppression:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;Power-based suppression&lt;/b&gt;: when a false institution suppresses truth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;Truth-based suppression&lt;/b&gt;: when a true institution suppresses falsehood&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Therefore,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;the real criterion is first identifying what is true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;(ie. what the earthly Jesus truly said)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;, not retroactively assuming it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;his argument cannot be used before establishing the truth of the claim, or else the logic becomes circular or speculative: &quot;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;hey were wrong because they lost, and they lost because they were wrong&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This argument also diminishes when the Gospels themselves depict Jesus&#39; victory as spiritual, not a worldly. As such, to be internally consistent, worldly victory does not necessarily indicate spiritual truth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The preserved manuscripts and independent streams corroborate one another.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;he redundancy from independent origins makes a late, singular fabrication highly improbable.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- It is true that later manuscripts converge and that multiple streams reinforce core events. However,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;this only disproves late fabrication:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;the real window of concern is whether&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;early fabrication (within 1–6 years after the crucifixion) could have occurred before the written Gospels, epistles, and preserved manuscripts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Therefore:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Later manuscript uniformity cannot eliminate the possibility that an early, unified fabrication became dominant. If such an early fabrication occurred and that was the dominant institution, then the preserved manuscripts would necessarily corroborate that same fabrication centuries later - especially if True texts were not preserved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- To address this possibility, we would need to first compare Jesus&#39; original message to both the claim and the potential fabrication (as both sides claim that he is their source of knowledge), before appealing to manuscript quantity and consistency as a defense.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Gospels contain embarrassing details that fabricators wouldn&#39;t intentionally include (as they are trying to win people over), and people willing to die for a claim wouldn&#39;t think that what they believe in is wrong.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Perhaps, but this makes quite a few assumptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- People have different priorities, and if people lie in order to gain in some way (that being honest doesn&#39;t), then they will maintain that lie so long as they&#39;re accomplishing their goal. As such, this argument assumes that a fabricator can&#39;t gain anything by weakening their argument or using embarrassing details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This also assumes that 1st century fabricators couldn&#39;t have been clever enough to know this, and use it to their advantage. Moreover, a fabricator may have included an embarrassing detail to fit within their narrative, or to perhaps hide a more embarrassing event that would be damaging to their fabrication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Therefore, the defense&#39;s strength depends on the belief that such clever fabrication is psychologically improbable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Therefore:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;While the embarrassment criterion can indeed support authenticity, it is not strong enough on its own to eliminate the possibility of deliberate fabrication without further investigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Differing Christologies don&#39;t contradict each other and reflect progressive revelation, not gradual development.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Both appeal to the same sources and involve incremental additions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;Progressive revelation&lt;/b&gt;: gradually reveals a new part of the whole Truth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;Gradual development&lt;/b&gt;: gradually reveals a new part of a developing falsehood&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Therefore,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;the real criterion is first identifying what is true (ie. what the earthly Jesus truly said), not retroactively assuming it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Progressive revelation cannot function as proof; it assumes the very thing it is trying to prove.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- If this argument is valid, then we can use the same data and logic to make the opposite claim (ie. differing Christologies show gradual development, not progressive revelation).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Without first assessing whether the claims align with what Jesus himself said, then both sides equally fit the data (ie. truth is indistinguishable from falsehood).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- This means that this argument&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;can only be persuasive after establishing that the earthly Jesus himself said. Otherwise, using it first would be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;circular reasoning: &quot;it&#39;s progressive revelation because it&#39;s true, and its truth is reflected in its progressive revelation&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- P&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;aul&#39;s authority is the strongest proof of the gospel&#39;s divine origin.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- If the claim&#39;s truth rests heavily on the truth of Paul&#39;s post-resurrection vision, then Paul first needs to be established as a reliable source of information. As such, he needs to be assessed under the same standards that we did with Jesus - meaning the elimination of him being a liar, lunatic, or demonically influenced.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;align=left;" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-86" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="180" width="315" height="935" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="935" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-89" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Eliminating all plausible natural pathways for fabrication or alteration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The Quran was revealed during Muhammad&#39;s lifetime.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The Quran indeed references historical events, shared disputes, and unfolding situations that clearly fit within a 7th-century Arabian context. However, a text that references a historical setting is not necessarily a text that originated in that setting. As such, we must distinguish between primary and secondary sources:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;Primary source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;: a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;text produced by eyewitnesses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Secondary source&lt;/b&gt;: a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;text produced by non-eyewitnesses, whose sources are eyewitness accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Therefore, the key criterion is identifying if the Quran contains information that only a primary eyewitnesses could have known.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;As such, t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;o trust the claim, the argument must show the presence of historically inaccessible details: information that could not be retroactively recovered or engineered by a later source.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 2px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Muhammad is the only possible candidate for the Quran&#39;s revelation.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- It is true that there is a strong, historical case for Muhammad orally transmitting the Quran, but his illiteracy and documented incapacity to produce such a sophisticated work makes it difficult to attribute him as the source - without appealing to a divine cause, as the Quran itself argues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- As a result, for this argument to have substance, it requires the elimination of natural explanations for the Quran&#39;s authorship, which reduces to the elimination alternative authors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;The analysis must show&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the established historical conditions of 7th-century Arabia could not have allowed the Quran to be produced, compiled, or shaped through hidden individuals or distributed networks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Therefore, the real criterion is whether the historical conditions make alternative authorship impossible, rather than merely unrecorded. The analysis must show:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;No individual alternative&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;no educated poet, scribe, monk, scholar, or informant possessed the combined linguistic, theological, and structural capacity to engineer a text of this scope and coherence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;No collaborative alternative&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;no political faction, tribal network, or scribal institution had both the capability and secrecy to produce (or coordinate) the Quran without contradiction, infiltration, exposure, or competing claims&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- &lt;b&gt;Internal consistency&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;no internal evidence of layered composition, stylistic plurality, editorial seams, or revision-patterns that would indicate distributed authorship, literary construction, or developmental redaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Only when these natural explanations are excluded by constraint - not simply absent from record - can the argument stand as a justified historical conclusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Quran&#39;s text was reliably preserved without alteration.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Public recitation, widespread memorization, and early manuscript activity indeed provide substantial evidence for preservation. However, if the Quran&#39;s preservation is attributed to divine intervention - as the text itself claims - then the historical defense necessitates the elimination of alternative explanations within the established historical constraints&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Therefore, the real criterion is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;whether the Quran&#39;s transmission environment closed every window of potential corruption before standardization. The analysis must show that:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;No monopolization&lt;/b&gt;: no early caliphate, scribal authority, or regional leader ever had exclusive control of the text long enough to modify it before public re-diffusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;No collaborative alternative&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;no political faction, tribal network, or scribal institution had both the capability and secrecy to produce (or coordinate) the Quran without contradiction, infiltration, exposure, or competing claims&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Internal consistency&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;no internal evidence of layered composition, stylistic plurality, editorial seams, or revision-patterns that would indicate distributed authorship, literary construction, or developmental redaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Only when these corruption windows are positively ruled out - not merely unrecorded - does the preservation claim move from probable to historically secure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Note that&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;each requirement ultimately reduces to the elimination of plausible alternatives - in the absence of documented alternatives. This reflects the distinction between &lt;b&gt;reasonable uncertainty&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;speculative doubt &lt;/b&gt;(or, &lt;b&gt;unreasonable uncertainty&lt;/b&gt;): the mere absence of rival narratives does not by itself prove exclusivity (since &quot;absence of evidence is not evidence of absence&quot;), but if a text originated publicly, was preserved from the outset, and faced no viable conditions for alternative versions to develop, then the absence of rivals is exactly what we would expect. Once a claim&#39;s environment leaves no plausible pathway for an alternative, demanding imaginary alternatives becomes speculation, not skepticism (since &quot;speculation is not refutation&quot;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;This guards against both &lt;b&gt;retroactive assumption&lt;/b&gt; (accepting a claim merely because no rival is recorded) and &lt;b&gt;hyperskepticism&lt;/b&gt; (rejecting a claim by inventing scenarios without evidence). Instead, we commit to evidence-based constraints applied to known history, ensuring that our conclusions rest on what is possible under the documented environment, not on blind trust or imaginative doubt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;" parent="bwPMnbwdrdVlshME2wuY-86" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="495" width="315" height="935" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="315" height="935" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
