        <UserObject label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;How reliable was the cultural context for preserving oral tradition accurately?&lt;/b&gt;" link="data:page/id,UnD5iH2WOAX1UBhe1G6C" id="rhcqr-XzwB1Ql8kuJBcr-152">
