  <diagram name="7. Non-Fundamental Comparison (4/7)" id="Ly_KY-rEEE6EdX8WcNej">
    <mxGraphModel dx="598" dy="-9269" grid="1" gridSize="5" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" background="#CCCCCC" math="0" shadow="0" adaptiveColors="none">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-0" />
        <mxCell id="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-0" />
        <UserObject label="Non-Fundamental Comparison: Christianity vs. Islam (4/7)" link="data:page/id,lkuSvPZcJC7dHRsydWrw" id="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-2">
          <mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E6E6E6;fontSize=20;" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="9920" width="810" height="50" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-0" value="" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="10030" width="810" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-46" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" parent="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="810" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-47" value="&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Under God&#39;s justice, which is greater/heavier: sin or righteousness/repentance?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#DAE8FC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#7EA6E0;opacity=85;" parent="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-46" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="160" height="150" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="160" height="150" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-48" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Sin &amp;gt; righteousness/repentance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;God is perfectly just: the wages of sin is death, and there is no forgiveness of sins without shedding blood (ie. some punishment or sacrifice). Since sanctifying grace is a participation in God&#39;s own life, it can&#39;t be recreated or restored by our finite efforts in righteousness and repentance; only a perfect being can restore it (ie. through Christ&#39;s perfect righteousness and vicarious atonement, whose resurrection defeated the penalty of death on our behalf).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;This is why no amount of righteousness or repentance can undo, revert, or otherwise pardon the guilt and penalty of even a single sin. This is also why Adam&#39;s sin (and ours) wasn&#39;t temporally forgiven - for its natural consequence is ongoing earthly toil, suffering, and separation from perfect communion with God - and how we&#39;re all able to be saved due to Christ&#39;s redeeming grace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;" parent="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-46" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" width="255" height="150" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="255" height="150" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-49" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Righteousness/repentance &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;≥&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;sin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;God is the Just: every action, no matter how big or small, will be taken into account, and no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another. God is also the Oft-Forgiving, Most-Loving:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;we&#39;re held accountable only to our knowledge and intentions, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;the path to forgiveness is opened before the path to punishment. As a result, God multiplies good deeds out of His mercy (while bad deeds are recorded as they are), erases previous sins with sincere repentance (even turning them into good deeds), and valuing lasting deeds of righteousness to outweigh isolated slips.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;This is why Adam&#39;s sin was only a slip in God&#39;s eyes - a momentary lapse of judgement between consistent obedience and sincere repentance (all willfully done) - and why he was forgiven once he turned back to God (which is the same for us as well).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;" parent="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-46" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="415" width="255" height="150" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="255" height="150" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-50" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sin &amp;gt; righteousness/repentance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Righteousness/repentance &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;≥&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;sin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;" parent="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-46" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="670" width="140" height="150" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="150" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-5" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;" parent="uVht4GMKU5NwHKT9WBcc-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="150" width="810" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-6" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;How is God&#39;s mercy revealed within His justice?&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#DAE8FC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#7EA6E0;opacity=85;" parent="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="160" height="180" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="160" height="180" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-7" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Sin must be punished, but God willingly took its burden for our sake&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;God expects perfect obedience to His will, and because God&#39;s justice is perfect, the debt of every sin must be satisfied. But since every sin is also against an infinite God,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;the penalty of sin is death (separation from God) -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;its weight far beyond our finite capacity to repay (or to recreate that grace) by our own righteousness or repentance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Yet, out of His love and desire for our salvation, God reveals His mercy by sending Christ - who lived sinlessly, willingly bore the penalty for our sins on our behalf (ie. death), and defeated it through his resurrection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;(despite us being undeserving of it)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;. In this way, both perfect justice and mercy are expressed: sin is truly punished, but its punishment is willingly borne by Christ instead of falling on us - allowing forgiveness to occur without compromising justice. As a result, our righteousness and repentance do not pay for sin, but follow as participation in Christ&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;perfection - with the eligibility for that mercy starting with our faith and trust in what he has done for us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;" parent="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" width="255" height="180" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="255" height="180" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-8" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Righteousness is rewarded while sin is punished, with God forgiving instead of punishing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;God expects a minimal standard of worship and obedience, expressed by faith, repentance, and righteousness - within one&#39;s real capacity (which is known and&amp;nbsp; determined by God for each person). As such, every person is held fully accountable only to their own deeds, with all actions personally owned and proportionally weighed under God&#39;s Justice: righteousness is rewarded and sin is punished.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Yet, out of His love and mercy, God opens the path to forgiveness before punishment by delaying penalty - multiplying good deeds, recording sins only as they are,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;rewarding excellence in superfluous good deeds,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;and erasing (even transforming) sins through sincere repentance and restitution to the best of one’s ability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;In this way, both perfect justice and mercy are expressed: each person receives exactly what they are accountable for, while God not dismissing or wasting the sincere righteous actions of believers - with the promise of sincere repentance being a direct doorway to forgiveness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;" parent="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="415" width="255" height="180" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="255" height="180" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-9" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sins are punished; forgiveness occurs after/by means of Christ willingly bearing the punishment on our behalf&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Righteousness is rewarded while sins are punished; forgiveness occurs before/instead of punishment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;" parent="YIbVQ4ue6nz4u20deVYZ-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="670" width="140" height="180" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="180" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="USrZIFFo2bwW6Lo8Z6gU-13" value="" style="group" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="10365" width="810" height="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-7wvId-txa0Bem-9DJUs-0" value="" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" parent="USrZIFFo2bwW6Lo8Z6gU-13" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="160" height="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-7wvId-txa0Bem-9DJUs-1" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="-7wvId-txa0Bem-9DJUs-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="160" height="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-7wvId-txa0Bem-9DJUs-2" value="&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What do the differences reveal about God and His justice and mercy?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#DCDBFC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#9393E0;opacity=85;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="-7wvId-txa0Bem-9DJUs-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="160" height="195" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="160" height="195" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-0" value="" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" parent="USrZIFFo2bwW6Lo8Z6gU-13" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" width="650" height="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-1" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="650" height="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-9" value="&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Both require God&#39;s mercy, but:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=#CCE5FF;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" height="35" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="35" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Justice requires sin to be satisfied by &lt;b&gt;punishment or sacrifice&lt;/b&gt; before&amp;nbsp;forgiveness can occur.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" width="185" height="35" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="35" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-10" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Justice requires &lt;b&gt;surplus&amp;nbsp;righteousness or sincere repentance&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;before&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;forgiveness can occur.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="325" width="185" height="35" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="35" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-4" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Punishment always occurs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Forgiveness waives punishment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" width="140" height="35" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="35" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-23" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="35" width="650" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-24" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;As a result of God&#39;s justice:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=#CCE5FF;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-23" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" height="40" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="40" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-25" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sin incurs a debt greater than the merit of any righteousness and repentance&lt;/b&gt; a person can do (for any sin is against the infinite God).&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-23" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" width="185" height="40" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="40" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-26" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sincere righteousness and repentance is rewarded and multiplied&lt;/b&gt; (by God&#39;s mercy) - unlike sins, which are recorded as is.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-23" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="325" width="185" height="40" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="40" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-27" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mercy is not embedded in the law&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mercy is embedded in the law&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-23" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" width="140" height="40" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="40" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-28" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="75" width="650" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-29" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;As a result of God&#39;s mercy:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=#CCE5FF;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-28" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" height="45" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="45" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-30" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Jesus Christ - &lt;b&gt;God in the human Person - willingly bore sin&#39;s debt for us&lt;/b&gt; (out of his love).&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-28" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" width="185" height="45" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="45" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-31" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;God delays punishment to give us abundant opportunities to be forgiven first&lt;/b&gt; - with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;sincere repentance able to erase and transform sins&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-28" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="325" width="185" height="45" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="45" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-32" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;God bore sin&#39;s penalty for us&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;We bear both our righteousness (including repentance) and sins&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-28" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" width="140" height="45" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="45" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-33" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="120" width="650" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-34" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;As a result of what God holds us accountable to:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=#CCE5FF;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-33" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-35" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;We can&#39;t satisfy the debt of sin ourselves, so &lt;b&gt;our salvation ultimately depends on God&#39;s grace in Christ&#39;s atonement and our faith in him&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;to be justified/eligible for that grace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Even with faith in Christ, &lt;b&gt;righteousness&lt;/b&gt; (with confession) &lt;b&gt;is still required to keep &amp;amp; participate&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;in God&#39;s grace - but it is not why we are saved&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-33" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" width="185" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-36" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our actions are personally and proportionally weighed&lt;/b&gt;, where our salvation depends on our faith, righteousness, and repentance - within the capacity God decreed for each of us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;With faith in God, &lt;b&gt;He accepts our sincere repentance, erases our sins, and multiplies our good deeds - thus waiving the punishment&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-33" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="325" width="185" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-37" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Salvation is grounded in Christ&#39;s righteousness, not our own&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Salvation is grounded in God&#39;s mercy by weighing our own faith, righteousness, and repentance against our sins&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-33" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" width="140" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-43" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=default;" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="10560" width="810" height="5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2Z5GjjlRzoepW60cy-sD-42" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=default;" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="10360" width="810" height="5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" link="data:page/id,PLmkqsxnITHKim_g8YDk" id="85xPAd0_dzV2PILsPwWW-0">
          <mxCell style="group" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
            <mxGeometry x="780" y="9920" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="85xPAd0_dzV2PILsPwWW-1" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=none;rotation=-180;opacity=1;" parent="85xPAd0_dzV2PILsPwWW-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="3.552713678800501e-15" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" id="85xPAd0_dzV2PILsPwWW-2">
          <mxCell style="shape=flexArrow;endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#B3B3B3;" parent="85xPAd0_dzV2PILsPwWW-0" edge="1">
            <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
              <mxPoint y="25.000000000000004" as="sourcePoint" />
              <mxPoint x="40" y="25.000000000000004" as="targetPoint" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" link="data:page/id,koprSnZA8Zx8r47souDI" id="upSU1_vMDPgU63rvSvS7-0">
          <mxCell style="group;rotation=-180;" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
            <mxGeometry x="20.000000000000004" y="9920" width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="upSU1_vMDPgU63rvSvS7-1" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#E6E6E6;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=none;rotation=-360;opacity=1;" parent="upSU1_vMDPgU63rvSvS7-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" id="upSU1_vMDPgU63rvSvS7-2">
          <mxCell style="shape=flexArrow;endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#B3B3B3;" parent="upSU1_vMDPgU63rvSvS7-0" edge="1">
            <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
              <mxPoint x="50" y="25" as="sourcePoint" />
              <mxPoint x="10" y="25" as="targetPoint" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="dqk3HK4CLpIu5oIegD6D-1" value="" style="group" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="10565" width="810" height="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-5" value="" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" parent="dqk3HK4CLpIu5oIegD6D-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" width="650" height="225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-6" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="650" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-7" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our actions are a sign of our moral values.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;This ties moral evaluation to what we &lt;i&gt;do&lt;/i&gt;, not what we &lt;i&gt;claim&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;(or &lt;i&gt;feel&lt;/i&gt;)&amp;nbsp;- the basis for accountability and justice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-8" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Actions are a participation in God&#39;s grace and perfection.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Faith by itself, if it has no works, is dead - even demons believe in God. As such, &lt;b&gt;righteousness is the necessary fruit and evidence of faith&lt;/b&gt;: if it is missing, then it reveals a necessary deficiency in faith. This makes it a strong fit with this inference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" width="185" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-9" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Actions are the external expression of one&#39;s internal submission to God.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The requirement for God&#39;s forgiveness is faith and righteousness&lt;/b&gt;, such that&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;the first people condemned by God are the hypocrites who claim to believe in Him but don&#39;t do so in their actions. This makes it a strong fit with this inference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="325" width="185" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-10" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Righteousness is a sign of inner faith&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;(strong fit)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Righteousness is a sign of inner faith&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;(strong fit)&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" width="140" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-11" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="75" width="650" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-12" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&quot;We have a disposition towards concepts of justice.&quot;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;This expects people to be held accountable to their choices, where the guilty bear a proportional cost - and the innocent are not punished.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-13" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Justice is &lt;i&gt;debt-centric&lt;/i&gt;: sin creates a spiritual debt that must be satisfied - such that it can be paid for by an eligible substitute.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Sin &lt;i&gt;causes&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;debt, but an eligible innocent &lt;i&gt;can&lt;/i&gt; pay it instead of the guilty.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;This means that &lt;b&gt;the essence of justice is settlement (with gratitude &amp;amp; love), not accountability&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- a weak fit with this inference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" width="185" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-14" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Justice is&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;credit-centric&lt;/i&gt;: both the debt of sin &lt;i&gt;and &lt;/i&gt;reward of righteousness are borne only by the guilty.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Every soul bears its own burden - accountable only to their choices&lt;/b&gt;: those guilty of sin will receive its due, and those guilty of righteousness will receive its due - a strong fit with this inference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="325" width="185" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-15" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Justice is about debt/settlement&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;(weak fit)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Justice is about credit/accountability&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;(strong fit)&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" width="140" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-16" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="150" width="650" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-17" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&quot;Falsehood is easier and more common, while good is harder and more valued.&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;This comes from the observation that righteousness (like order) requires personal maintenance - while sin (like disorder) requires personal neglect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="140" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-18" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Human righteousness&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;is&lt;/i&gt; harder, but it cannot outweigh human sin.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Sin causes our ineligibility for salvation, while good can&#39;t restore it - but Christ&#39;s perfection can.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;This means that &lt;b&gt;the essence of good&#39;s value is restricted to God&#39;s goodness, not the effort it requires&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;- making it a partial fit with this inference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" width="185" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-19" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Human righteousness&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;is&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;harder, therefore it outweighs human sin.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Evil is easier and more common, but &lt;b&gt;good is weighted more strongly in judgement&lt;/b&gt; - precisely because God embeds His mercy in the judgement and values more the hard path and sincere return. This makes it a strong fit with this inference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="325" width="185" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="185" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-20" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The effort for righteousness is not a basis for its value, out of God&#39;s mercy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3), rgba(0, 43, 0, 0.3)); font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(partial fit)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The effort for righteousness is a basis for its value, out of God&#39;s mercy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3), rgba(24, 46, 68, 0.3)); font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(strong fit)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" width="140" height="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-1" value="" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" parent="dqk3HK4CLpIu5oIegD6D-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="225" width="650" height="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-2" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="650" height="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Islam accomplishes everything the Christian Jesus does, but with a more original and perfect form of accountability, consistency, and better fitting the mold of a &quot;loving father&quot; - allowing a stronger case for coherence to be built.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;At its root, the fundamental difference between the two narratives is how God’s justice is oriented (debt vs. credit) - and the basis for salvation (including how God responds to Adam&#39;s sin) follows from that.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;For Christianity’s justice, all sins must be paid for. The core &quot;debt of [human] sin&quot; (loss of sanctifying grace) sits in a higher tier than any act of human righteousness: no amount of good deeds can recreate that grace - only participating in it (only if restored by God) - which is what God shows by expelling Adam from Eden. But, out of His mercy, God Himself satisfies this debt on our behalf through Christ - certainly revealing God&#39;s love for us. However, it also exposes concepts such as an innocent bearing the burden of the guilty (both in Adam’s descendants sharing the debt of his act and in Christ satisfying the debt for us), sin’s debt being valued in a higher category than righteousness’ credit (despite God&#39;s mercy), and God’s treatment of Adam after his sin being different than Christ&#39;s (ie. God in the human Person) treatment of sincere believers after their sins - each challenging our predisposition towards accountability and justice.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Meanwhile, Islam’s justice holds each person fully accountable for their own actions - crediting both sins and good deeds - with God, out of His mercy, valuing our sincere righteousness and repentance over our sins. God&#39;s relationship with Adam is the same as His relationship with us today: Adam sins, repents, and is forgiven, and is placed on earth fully forgiven and pure while being judged only for his own choices. As a result, this narrative does not accept concepts such as an innocent bearing the burden of the guilty (which would be unjust) or sin being valued more than righteousness (which would contradict God’s mercy and align with Satan’s desire for us to despair of it).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Therefore: even though both affirm God&#39;s justice and mercy/love, Islam&#39;s narrative cleanly fits our natural disposition for personal accountability while Christianity&#39;s narrative leads to concepts that don&#39;t cleanly fit. Moreover, the Islamic God is more consistent and better fits the mold of a &quot;loving father&quot;, treating Adam the same way He treats us: with original forgiveness, mercy, and justice. As a result, Islam better fits reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=#CCE5FF;gradientDirection=east;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="510" height="205" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="510" height="205" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-4" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Partial accountability&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;(weak fit)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Perfect accountability&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;(strong fit)&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" width="140" height="205" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="140" height="205" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-21" value="" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" parent="dqk3HK4CLpIu5oIegD6D-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="160" height="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-22" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-21" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="160" height="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-23" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;What is the core, fundamental difference between the two salvific narratives - and which&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;better fits reality?&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#E6D0DE;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;gradientColor=#D5739D;opacity=85;swimlaneFillColor=none;" parent="On3Kb4ZQPkZ-tGZvENjp-22" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="160" height="430" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="160" height="430" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RdZeSiheyACBelOjpGTK-0" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Which salvific narrative better fits reality? (continued)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=18;fillColor=#D5E8D4;gradientColor=#97D077;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="7JXjeWlxQTD8vJp8OddA-1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="9985" width="810" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="7. Non-Fundamental Comparison (5/7)" id="PLmkqsxnITHKim_g8YDk">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1573" dy="-8939" grid="1" gridSize="5" guides="0" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" background="#CCCCCC" math="0" shadow="0" adaptiveColors="none">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="r1CXoWlgnHUmqX046EKh-0" />
        <mxCell id="r1CXoWlgnHUmqX046EKh-1" parent="r1CXoWlgnHUmqX046EKh-0" />
        <UserObject label="Non-Fundamental Comparison: Christianity vs. Islam (5/7)" link="data:page/id,lkuSvPZcJC7dHRsydWrw" id="r1CXoWlgnHUmqX046EKh-2">
          <mxCell parent="r1CXoWlgnHUmqX046EKh-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E6E6E6;fontSize=20;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="50" width="810" x="20" y="9920" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="XFWYUSE1HTdMzx_VAsHh-0" parent="r1CXoWlgnHUmqX046EKh-1" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="810" x="20" y="10030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XFWYUSE1HTdMzx_VAsHh-1" parent="XFWYUSE1HTdMzx_VAsHh-0" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XFWYUSE1HTdMzx_VAsHh-3" parent="XFWYUSE1HTdMzx_VAsHh-1" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=#666666;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCCCCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;gradientColor=none;swimlaneFillColor=none;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;In other words: if one salvific narrative is fully true, then the differences in the other would be examples of deceptive corruption of that truth. So, if we test them by assuming their truth, which of the narratives better matches the pattern we would expect a corruption to have? (Should be the same answer as previous section)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="810" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="45" width="810" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VXdAlL2PpDh6i4EO7z2b-1" parent="XFWYUSE1HTdMzx_VAsHh-0" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="155" width="810" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VXdAlL2PpDh6i4EO7z2b-2" parent="VXdAlL2PpDh6i4EO7z2b-1" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=#CCE5FF;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;What do those who deceive want? What is Satan&#39;s ultimate goal?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;In both Islam and Christianity, Satan is the archetype of deception. His ultimate goal is to separate us from God: from rightly knowing Him and having faith in His mercy, from fulfilling our God-given purpose, and from accepting reality and living the truth that would earn God&#39;s pleasure. If what is real decides what is true, then his strategy ultimately reduces to corrupting our perception of reality, making us feel confident in what is fundamentally, partially, or even subtly false.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;At a tactical level, this looks like lying about essential truths (about God, ourselves, and the world), repackaging falsehood as more coherent, comforting,, intuitive, or empowering than the truth, introducing precise distortions that simulate depth and complexity, magnifying extremes (exaggeration, reductionism, or otherwise imbalanced emphasis), blurring the line between ignorance/mystery and contradiction, and exploiting our vulnerabilities - ignorance, ego, despair, arrogance, tribalism, love of ease, desire for superiority, emotional volatility, misplaced identity, and worldly attachment - all so that we &lt;i&gt;want&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;the false narrative to be true.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;What does deception look like? What is the epistemological difference between deception and correction?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;If closeness to reality is closeness to truth (and thus to God), then the best deception is rarely the crude, obvious lie. Rather, it would be an almost-true narrative that feels coherent (using the truth to justify the falsehood), spiritually rich (masking contradiction as complexity), or emotionally satisfying (confusing comfort with truth) - diverging from the truth just enough, and slowly inching closer towards falsehood to avoid detection.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Epistemologically, this will always reduce to core contradictions being marketed as mysteries, paradoxes, or some other form of valid ignorance - manufacturing a false sense of harmony, and justifying coherence by appealing to ignorance when a clean correspondence with reality exists. As a result: if basic understanding of reality is required to identify the True religion, and if we assume that either Islam or Christianity is that True religion, then we can test their relative truth by comparing their differences to our basic understanding of reality - ascertaining which looks more like a corrupted version of the other (resulting in the other being its correction).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="155" width="810" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="155" width="810" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VXdAlL2PpDh6i4EO7z2b-4" parent="r1CXoWlgnHUmqX046EKh-1" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="765" width="75" x="20" y="10230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VXdAlL2PpDh6i4EO7z2b-5" parent="VXdAlL2PpDh6i4EO7z2b-4" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="765" width="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VXdAlL2PpDh6i4EO7z2b-6" parent="VXdAlL2PpDh6i4EO7z2b-5" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Let&#39;s assume that Christianity is true. What deceptive changes would Islam introduce?&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="765" width="75" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="765" width="75" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
