        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-11" connectable="0" parent="r1CXoWlgnHUmqX046EKh-1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="285" width="660" x="95" y="10490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-72" parent="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-11" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250.00000000000003" width="660" y="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-73" parent="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-72" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-74" parent="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-73" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Justice is the settlement of sin&#39;s debt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Justice is the recompense/credit for both sin and righteousness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Perfect justice is when the debt of every sin is paid - either by the sinner or a qualified substitute - and no human act or merit can undo it (on its own).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God&#39;s law (including faith in God) doesn&#39;t erase guilt or restore communion: it exposes testifies against our sin - effectively condemning us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Federal headship: the actions of one individual can change the spiritual status of others (as with original/ancestral sin applying from Adam to us, and with Christ&#39;s atonement satisfying the debt for all humanity).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Islam then changes this to justice being proportional accountability: all actions (both good and bad) have salvific weight, with each person judged only by their God-given capacity and carrying only their own burden.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Neither human sin nor human righteousness occur &quot;on their own&quot;: they both occur by God&#39;s will, and their spiritual impact also occurs by God&#39;s will.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God&#39;s law (including faith in God) exposes both our good and bad: all our culpable actions will be justly recompensed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The law&#39;s emphasis on settlement shifts to accountability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Divine justice is embedded in the law - making federal headship unjust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Increasing accountability (justifying it using God&#39;s mercy)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Increasing divine justice within the law&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="250" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-75" parent="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-73" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#E6E6E6;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⬆&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;accountability,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;⬆&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;divine justice in the law&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬇ &lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3), rgba(24, 46, 68, 0.3));&quot;&gt;accountability,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬇&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3), rgba(24, 46, 68, 0.3));&quot;&gt;weight of righteousness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="110" x="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="250" width="110" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-76" parent="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-73" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Justice is the recompense/credit for both sin and righteousness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Justice is the settlement of sin&#39;s debt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Perfect justice is when every person is only responsible for what they do within their capacity, both with good and bad deeds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Every person receives proportional recompense (reward or punishment) based on the merit of their actions (for both good and bad deeds).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Good deeds are multiplied out of God&#39;s mercy while sins are recorded as they are, and sincere repentance merits God&#39;s forgiveness by His leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Christianity then changes this to the weight of sin being beyond human capacity to satisfy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The spiritual impact of righteousness is diminished in God&#39;s law, while the spiritual impact of sin is kept.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Innocents can now bear others&#39; burdens: with Adam&#39;s descendants being born in a fallen state, and with Christ satisfying the burden for all humanity&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;(as extra-law divine intervention)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God can now hold us accountable to a burden beyond our capacity (now resolved through extra-law divine intervention).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Innocents can now bear others&#39; burdens&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Decreasing accountability (justifying it using God&#39;s mercy)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Decreasing the spiritual impact of righteousness (out of God&#39;s justice)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="275" x="385" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="250" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-77" parent="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-11" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;gradientColor=none;fillColor=default;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="35" width="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-78" parent="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-77" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="35" width="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-79" parent="Nc2L-sOt32mwzoiLI38P-78" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#FFDEC9;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=#FFB663;gradientDirection=south;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How was God&#39;s justice changed?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="35" width="660" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="35" width="660" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
