          <mxGeometry height="260" width="660" x="95" y="10230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-0" parent="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-12" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="225" width="660" y="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-1" parent="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-0" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="225" width="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-2" parent="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-1" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;God expects total perfection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;God expects sincerity with a finite set of obligations, only within one&#39;s capacity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Out of God’s perfect justice, He expects perfection: every sin incurs a real debt that must be paid.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- As a result, the occurrence of any culpable sin severs us from perfect, holy communion with God - until later divine intervention restores it (with Jesus).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Moreover,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;human righteousness (by itself) can&#39;t outweigh or cancel the cost of human sin (ie. recreating the state of grace that only God bestows).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Islam then changes God&#39;s expectations to be the fulfilment of obligations with sincerity - with anything more being considered as &quot;excellence&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Sin still has a debt that can only be resolved by God&#39;s grace - which now manifests directly in the law itself: repentance and righteousness are both given salvific weight, capable of offsetting that of sin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;(only by God&#39;s mercy)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God&#39;s fundamental expectation shifts from perfection to sincerity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Righteousness and repentance gain opposing power against sin.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To embed God&#39;s mercy in His expectations, framing its as more original...&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- ... without sacrificing justice, in holding us fully accountable to our sins&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="225" width="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="225" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-5" parent="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-1" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#E6E6E6;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬆ God&#39;s mercy,&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;= God&#39;s justice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬆ God&#39;s expectations,&lt;br&gt;⬇ weight of good deeds&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: light-dark(rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3), rgba(24, 46, 68, 0.3));&quot;&gt;,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬇ our status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: light-dark(rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3), rgba(24, 46, 68, 0.3));&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬇ God&#39;s mercy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="225" width="110" x="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="225" width="110" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-7" parent="ZL-Y2L52Jh8ZLN4RljHD-1" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;God expects sincerity with a finite set of obligations, only within one&#39;s capacity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;God expects&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;total perfection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Out of God’s perfect justice, He expects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;the fulfilment of obligations with sincerity - with anything more being considered as &quot;excellence&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Sincere repentance and lasting acts of righteousness can offset and erase sins, and God does not hold anyone accountable for what is beyond their capacity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Christianity then changes God&#39;s expectations to be total perfection: the occurrence of even one culpable sin causes a spiritual death - one that human righteousness no longer has the merit to restore it by itself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- We are now born in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;spiritually fallen state (instead of being born pure)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- ... with our honor and salvation being restored only through Jesus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God&#39;s fundamental expectation shifts from sincerity to perfection.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Righteousness is still meritorious given the existence of faith...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- ... but salvation shifts to God&#39;s grace in Jesus rather than our good deeds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To diminish righteousness, repentance, and our status in God&#39;s eyes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To make us lose faith in God&#39;s original, built-in mercy - putting it elsewhere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="225" width="275" x="385" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="225" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oIxCu5UkMhoze8bENyrH-0" parent="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-12" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" value="" vertex="1">
