        <mxCell id="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-4" parent="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-3" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Mercy is not embedded in the law&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Mercy is embedded in the law&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- If we are held perfectly accountable to the law, none of us would be able to fulfill it - as even one sin tarnishes or damages our spiritual state.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Christ&#39;s perfection in his unique, atoning sacrifice serves as God&#39;s grace and divine intervention by fulfilling the fullness of our burden on our behalf...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- ... Ordinarily given by faith in Christ and sincerely fulfilling the sacraments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Islam then changes this to the law &lt;i&gt;being&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;faith and the sincere fulfillment of sacraments from the start, where good repels sin out of God&#39;s mercy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- We are still only saved by God&#39;s grace - but it manifests directly in the law&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The effective division between law and grace is removed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God&#39;s mercy manifests in His reward of good, not in Him fulfilling the bad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Increasing God&#39;s mercy in the law (without sacrificing His grace around it)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="185" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-5" parent="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-3" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#E6E6E6;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⬆&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;God&#39;s mercy,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;=&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;God&#39;s grace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬇ God&#39;s mercy,&lt;br&gt;= God&#39;s grace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="110" x="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="185" width="110" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-6" parent="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-3" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mercy is embedded in the law&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Mercy is not embedded in the law&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- If God were to instantly hold us accountable to our deeds, we would all be punished (ie. natural negative consequence).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God&#39;s mercy manifests in delaying that punishment (during life) - providing each of us the opportunity for righteousness, repentance, and forgiveness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Christianity then changes this by creating a division between God&#39;s law and God&#39;s grace, where the law condemns while His grace saves.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- We are still delayed from sin&#39;s eternal punishment, given the opportunity to turn to God for forgiveness in this life, and primarily saved by God&#39;s grace - but the law is no longer where His mercy and forgiveness manifest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- An effective division between law and grace is added.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Decreasing the reach of God&#39;s mercy (from the law)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="275" x="385" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="185" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Qq2cjtbxKfGWNr3Z9PaS-7" parent="PBfdTqHUAf5LH3LXXbxw-0" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" value="" vertex="1">
