        <mxCell id="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-6" connectable="0" parent="s9g_Rb6IgTgleTRQmnDC-1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="275" width="660" x="95" y="10030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-8" parent="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-6" style="shape=table;startSize=0;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fontSize=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="660" y="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-9" parent="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-8" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-10" parent="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-9" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;God is Triune&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;God is One&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God is one in essence and three in Persons: Father, Son, and Holy Spirit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The Son is both fully human and fully God: fully divine yet fully personal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The Persons are neither distinct in essence nor in mode/form/appearance, such that their distinction is transcendent beyond human comprehension.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Islam then changes God nature to a strict monotheism, where He is fully transcendent and His essence is best described as &quot;One&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God transcends His creation and attributing biological concepts to Him is unbefitting - yet He is closer to each of us than our own lifelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- As a result, attributing any plurality - or humanness - to God is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;closer to polytheism than monotheism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Jesus is fully human, a Deliverer of the Gospel, and a Messenger of God.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The Holy Spirit is the angel Gabriel and the angelic Messenger from God.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- No plurality or creationness can be attributed to God.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The irrational definition of personhood is removed from God&#39;s transcendence - while keeping the incomprehensibility of God&#39;s existence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Jesus is a human, and the Holy Spirit is an angel - and neither are God.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To increase God&#39;s oneness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To increase the rationality of God&#39;s transcendence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="240" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-11" parent="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-9" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#E6E6E6;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⬆&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;God&#39;s oneness,&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;⬆&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;God&#39;s rationality&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬇ God&#39;s oneness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: light-dark(rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3), rgba(24, 46, 68, 0.3));&quot;&gt;,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬇ God&#39;s rationality&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="110" x="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="240" width="110" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-12" parent="dyAkvh6oCZAIHyciMj3W-9" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;God is One&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;God is Triune&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God is absolutely One: He is indivisible, without internal or external plurality of any kind, and in a transcendent classification above all creation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- All other beings are God&#39;s servants: nothing occurs without His permission, nor can any will override or rival above God&#39;s will.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Christianity then changes God&#39;s pure oneness as a Trinity: one essence shared by three distinct Persons (ie. Father, Son, and Holy Spirit).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Each Person is fully God, without there being three Gods nor three forms or manifestations of the same God.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Jesus is now the Person of the Son, and the angel Gabriel is no longer the Holy Spirit - with salvation now requiring faith in both, not just in the Father.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- An internal plurality can now be attributed to God.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- An irrational definition an now be attributed to God.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Faith in a being that is fully man is now required for salvation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To redirect our faith from the pure, undivided oneness of God&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;To introduce irrationality in God&#39;s description and conceptualization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="275" x="385" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="240" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
