        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-9" parent="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-8" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=16;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-10" parent="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-9" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCFFCC;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Satan is this world&#39;s ruler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Satan is only a whisperer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Satan is a fallen angel who freely rebelled against God out of pride, being entirely motivated in drawing others into his rebellion.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- He is the ruler of this world, the god of this age, and the prince of power of the air - holding the world in a kind of spiritual captivity through deception, lies, and fear of death.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- His power is strictly derivative and limited: he can only act by God&#39;s permission, and Christ&#39;s death and resurrection are the decisive defeat of his dominion - guaranteeing his condemnation in the lake of fire.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Islam then changes Satan into being a jinn who fell from his earned, angel-like status - now enitirely motivated in dragging as many of us as possible into hell with him, out of envy of God&#39;s honoring of mankind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- He can only whisper and tempt implicitly by deception, lies, appealing to our desires, and beautifying falsehood - all by God&#39;s permission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- He has no effective power over those who believe and put their trust in God: he is only able to influence those who accept his temptation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Satan changes from being a fallen angel to being a fallen jinn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- While both narratives affirm that Satan can only act by God&#39;s permission and that we have the will to resist his temptation, the emphasis on his power shifts from being an dominant ruler to being only a tempting whisperer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To further belittle Satan&#39;s power&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(further emphasizing our accountability and ability to resist his temptation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="270" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-11" parent="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-9" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#E6E6E6;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3);&quot;&gt;⬇&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.3); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Satan&#39;s apparent power&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;vs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px; background-color: rgba(204, 229, 255, 0.3);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;⬆&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Satan&#39;s apparent power&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="110" x="275" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="270" width="110" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-12" parent="2TYUhzOEW-44EhP0R0Hl-9" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#CCE5FF;top=1;left=1;bottom=1;right=1;pointerEvents=1;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;spacingLeft=1;spacingRight=1;spacingBottom=0;spacingTop=-2;swimlaneFillColor=none;gradientColor=none;gradientDirection=east;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Satan is only a whisperer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;➡&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Satan is this world&#39;s ruler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original Truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Satan is a jinn who disobeyed God&#39;s command to bow down to Adam - and persisted in that arrogance, out of pride for his creation (of fire, over Adam&#39;s creation of clay) and envy from the higher honor given to mankind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- God granted him respite (from his punishment) until the Day of Judgement, during which he promises to misguide as many of us as he can.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- His power is only influential: he can only whisper, appeal to our desires, and lie - without being able to compel anyone into misguidance or having authority over anyone who is truly sincere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- On the Day of Judgement, he will deny responsibility for anyone&#39;s sins - exposing that they all had the power to choose not to follow him.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;False Corruption&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Christianity then changes Satan&#39;s identity, portraying him as a fallen angel who exercised real authority over the world order (which is overcome by Christ&#39;s sacrifice and will ultimately end upon his return).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- He is described as the ruler of this world and god of this age, keeping us in a spiritual captivity through sin, idolatry, and fear of death.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- While he can still only act under God&#39;s persmission, his dominion is such that the world itself is under his sway (until the return of Christ).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Effective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Satan is elevated from a jinn to an angel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Satan&#39;s power and dominion is more emphasized.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of Deception&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- To magnify Satan&#39;s apparent authority (by confusing it with the prevalence of evil and people accepting his temptation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="275" x="385" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="270" width="275" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
