  <diagram name="Results &amp; Conclusion (2/3)" id="dZVplhlVTvyQHVP8LEqG">
    <mxGraphModel dx="961" dy="-9035" grid="1" gridSize="5" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" background="#CCCCCC" math="0" shadow="0" adaptiveColors="none">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-0" />
        <mxCell id="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-1" parent="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-0" />
        <UserObject label="Results and Conclusion (2/3&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;" link="data:page/id,lkuSvPZcJC7dHRsydWrw" id="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-2">
          <mxCell parent="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E6E6E6;fontSize=20;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="50" width="810" x="20" y="9920" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-3" parent="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;This project began with a simple question: &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;How can we distinguish between truth and falsehood?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Here is the sieve we built:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;1. Pursuit of Truth:&lt;/b&gt; truth is external to me and anchored in reality, not my preference. If I am unwilling to be corrected, then I&#39;m not pursuing truth but my own affirmation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 230, 204);&quot;&gt;2. Discovering Reality:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;we observe stable patterns in reality - with limitations. Truth is neither identical to nor blocked by perception: it is found by iterative, consistent inference.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 204);&quot;&gt;3. Building Confidence:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;no claim can justify itself by assuming itself: any method that can &quot;prove&quot; falsehood can&#39;t be used to verify truth.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(204, 255, 204);&quot;&gt;4. Defining God:&lt;/b&gt; if the source of reality is defined as &quot;God&quot;, and our purpose defined by &quot;religion&quot;, then we can deduce:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - God possesses ultimate power, transcendence, intelligence, awareness, and will.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - The True religion corresponds to God&#39;s will, distinguishes mysteries from contradictions, and requires faith founded on reason.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(204, 204, 255);&quot;&gt;5. Alignment with Reality:&lt;/b&gt; comparing various worldviews to these inferences and deductions results in:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Rejection of Atheism and Polytheism&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Possibility of Trinitarianism - only if it has superior historicity to all other candidates, and only when also inferring that&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&quot;inferring about reality doesn&#39;t lead to spiritual truth&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(229, 204, 255);&quot;&gt;6. Historical Comparison:&lt;/b&gt; comparing the historicity of the New Testament (source of Trinitarianism) and the Quran (source of pure Monotheism) results in:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - New Testament&#39;s historicity requires speculation to be strong.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Quran&#39;s historicity requires speculation to be weak.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 204, 230);&quot;&gt;7. Non-Fundamental Comparison:&lt;/b&gt; comparing the theology of Christianity (religion of the New Testament) and Islam (religion of the Quran) results in:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Christianity appears more like a corruption of Islam.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Islam appears more like a correction of Christianity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;As the end of this process, the conclusion is not simply &quot;Islam is true&quot;, but more specifically: if the goal is to distinguish truth from falsehood, and if we refuse methods that make truth indistinguishable from falsehood, and if we refuse methods that make fabrication indistinguishable from truth, then the remaining candidates must be the one that maximizes correspondence with reality, coherence, non-circular confidence, and historically constrained authority. Based on the evidence (shown previously in each section of the project), &lt;b&gt;the only candidate that satisfies all this is Islam.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="810" x="20.03" y="9985" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-4" parent="spOUt6kHtWot4wZqUlVD-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;gradientColor=#b3b3b3;strokeColor=#666666;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The Cost of Disagreement&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;You can disagree with the conclusion. But now you aren&#39;t forced to disagree &lt;i&gt;vaguely&lt;/i&gt;: you can now validate any disagreement by identifying which filter you reject - and what that rejection forces you to accept instead. Below is the sieve again, but with the cost of disagreement at each step:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;At every stage, disagreement is possible - but the pattern is consistent, where the cost of disagreement is usually the same. You must grant falsehood the same privileges as truth - or, reject the process itself, which requires the identification of an alternative - which dissolves the original question.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="690" width="810.14" x="19.86" y="10300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
